review_comments:
@ArthurZucker custom pre-processing is in the plans for the `generate` refactor, and this should definitely be moved there (see step 2d in the [refactor plans](https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVNgMGfaQ=/), link only available to HF members for now). A separate file with extensions is a good idea!

Passing the tokenizer is an exception that we are accepting in other places -- e.g. see [this stopping criteria](https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/e0c3cee17085914bbe505c159beeb8ae39bc37dd/src/transformers/generation/stopping_criteria.py#L139), which was added due to community request to stop generation in specific text strings.

In summary, token healing is "free performance" for generation and @ahmed-moubtahij did a lot of work with this PR. I would like to include it now and move it to a better location at refactor time, unless you heavily oppose 🤗
